/**
 * Ruyi Comprehensive Demo — Stdlib Showcase
 *
 * A comprehensive demonstration covering 44 stdlib modules across 9 sections.
 * Each section showcases a group of related modules working together in realistic
 * patterns. All networking sections are self-contained (no external dependencies).
 *
 * Usage:
 *   ruyic comprehensive_demo.ry -o demo && ./demo
 *
 * Sections:
 *   1. Core Types      — error, option, io, log
 *   2. File System     — fs, path, compress, encoding, buffer
 *   3. Data Processing — json, csv, sort, regex, string, collections
 *   4. Cryptography    — crypto (hash, hmac, pbkdf2, aes, dh, random), uuid
 *   5. Concurrency     — thread, channel, fiber, mutex, atomic, semaphore,
 *                        barrier, condvar, once, rwlock, thread_local
 *   6. Date & Time     — datetime, time, fmt
 *   7. Math & Numbers  — math, bigint, random
 *   8. Networking      — net, net_async, http, websocket, tls, mqtt
 *   9. Serialization   — serialize, pool, collections
 *
 * @author Ruyi Team
 * @date 2026-07-25
 */

// =============================================================================
// Core & I/O
// =============================================================================
